---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT k, r FROM (SELECT a + 1 AS k, rank() OVER (PARTITION BY a + 1 ORDER BY c) AS r FROM t) WHERE k > 0"
---
Project [(a#0 + 1) AS k#3, _we0#6 AS r#4]
+- Filter ((a#0 + 1) > 0)
   +- Window [rank() OVER (PARTITION BY _w0#5 ORDER BY c#2 ASC NULLS FIRST ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS _we0#6], [_w0#5], [c#2 ASC NULLS FIRST]
      +- Project [a#0, c#2, (a#0 + 1) AS _w0#5]
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, c#2]
